    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a> implementation allowing a <a href=\"../PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> creating\n<a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converters</code></a> to be chosen.",
      "translation": "实现 <a href=\"../PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a>，允许通过 <a href=\"../PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> 创建并选择 <a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>converters</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Helper method used to create a <a href=\"../PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a> instance with the configured\n<a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converters</code></a> provided by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>callback</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于通过由<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util.function\"><code>callback</code></a>提供的配置的<a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converters</code></a>创建<a href=\"../PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a>实例的辅助方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new ConverterConfiguration holding the given <a href=\"../CustomConversions.StoreConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.StoreConversions</code></a> and user defined converters as\nwell as a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/GenericConverter.ConvertiblePair.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>GenericConverter.ConvertiblePair</code></a> for which to skip the registration of default converters.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 ConverterConfiguration，其中包含给定的 <a href=\"../CustomConversions.StoreConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.StoreConversions</code></a> 以及用户定义的转换器，同时包含一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>，该集合中列出了需要跳过默认转换器注册的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/GenericConverter.ConvertiblePair.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>GenericConverter.ConvertiblePair</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets a reference to the configured <a href=\"../PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a> if property value conversions are supported by\nthe underlying data store.",
      "translation": "如果底层数据存储支持属性值转换，则获取配置的<a href=\"../PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a>的引用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "General purpose conversion framework to read objects from a data store abstraction and write it back.",
      "translation": "通用转换框架，用于从数据存储抽象中读取对象并将其写回。",
